{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 13392, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11333, "text": "Anybody read the newspapers today?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 15795, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 14703, "text": "These aren't bibs, sir."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 20875, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17906, "text": "I can't believe it.\nI feel like I've been stabbed in the back."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 23033, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21042, "text": "My whole world\nis just crumbling around me."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 24235, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23211, "text": "Harry, what happened?"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 25811, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 24412, "text": "Entertainment Section, Page 9."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 28313, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25981, "text": "Little square\nin the bottom right-hand corner."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 30348, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28483, "text": "\"Mel Tormé reschedules New York date..."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 33954, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30518, "text": "...to give command performance\nfor the royal family.\""}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 36523, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 34589, "text": "My God."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 39021, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37258, "text": "I've had tickets for months."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 42061, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39194, "text": "Sixth row, center."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 43959, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42230, "text": "I wish I was dead."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 47994, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44399, "text": "Hey, what a great day to be alive, huh?"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 51135, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49270, "text": "I guess he didn't hear, sir."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 55436, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51306, "text": "The sun is shining, the birds are singing\nand IBM just doubled its pretax revenues."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 57237, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55610, "text": "No kidding. That's great."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 60472, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57412, "text": "- I stand to make a killing.\n- Hey, I didn't know you were a stockholder."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 61740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60648, "text": "Yeah, I got a share."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 66313, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62684, "text": "One share? You're so cute."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 68217, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66488, "text": "Well, I just like to dabble a little."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 72053, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68390, "text": "Hey, don't dabble. Diversify, like me."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 74320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72227, "text": "I have leaseback arrangements\non private jets."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 76964, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74496, "text": "I've got foreign exclusions\non Brazilian condos."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 79657, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77132, "text": "My portfolio just topped 75 thou."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 81768, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79834, "text": "And what time is the IRS audit?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 84427, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81936, "text": "One hour, two minutes and 40 seconds."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 86471, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84606, "text": "- You're being audited?\n- Yeah, yeah."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 90270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86641, "text": "I'm not worried, though, you know.\nI've covered myself pretty well."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 93471, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90445, "text": "So that's a real receipt, huh?"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 97046, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 94282, "text": "You know, I bet the queen\ndoesn't even appreciate scat."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 98913, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 97218, "text": "You were mumbling\nabout something, sir?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 101317, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99087, "text": "Harry is upset.\nMel Tormé rescheduled a concert."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 105152, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101489, "text": "Oh, yes, the first sign of Armageddon."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 108092, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105760, "text": "If anybody needs me,\nI'll be in the hallway..."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 110993, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 108263, "text": "...lying in a pool of blood."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 118869, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 114569, "text": "I have no reason to live anymore."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 123744, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 120809, "text": "That's never stopped me."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 171221, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168423, "text": "Still thinking about Mel Tormé,\naren't you, sir?"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 173417, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 171392, "text": "- He just got married.\n- Isn't that nice?"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 176689, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 173595, "text": "- I didn't get an invitation or nothing.\n- I'm sorry, sir."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 178856, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 176865, "text": "- I mean, we're not that close, but...\n- Sir."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 181297, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 179033, "text": "I sent him a dinnerware set."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 183463, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 181836, "text": "Well, I'll bet he appreciated that."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 185765, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183638, "text": "Yeah, he sent me a letter back.\nSee that?"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 189603, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185940, "text": "That's a genuine facsimile\nof his signature."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 191202, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 190178, "text": "Hey, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 193142, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191379, "text": "Hey, Art. What can I do for you?"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 195782, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 193314, "text": "I got a work order here\nfor some graffiti eradication."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 199886, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 195950, "text": "Oh, yeah. Somebody carved some\nnasty things on that first bench over there."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 201078, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 200054, "text": "- Really?\n- Yeah."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 205192, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201256, "text": "Some pretty rough stuff\nabout David and Julie Eisenhower."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 208090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 205360, "text": "Will they ever get any peace?"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 214591, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 211599, "text": "Three, two, one."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 217738, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 214769, "text": "We have audit liftoff."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 221871, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 219073, "text": "Right now, Sy should be\ndazzling those IRS bumpkins..."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 224409, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 222043, "text": "...with his tax-loophole expertise."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 227480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224579, "text": "You really think the world\nof this accountant, don't you?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 232018, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227649, "text": "I'd wax his Seville with my tongue\nif he asked me to."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 233677, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232187, "text": "Next case, Your Honor, Herb Gilpin."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 236119, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233855, "text": "Breaking and entering\nand destruction of property."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 237883, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236291, "text": "What's the story?"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 240323, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238059, "text": "Uh, the defendant threw a sofa\nthrough the front window..."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 244363, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240495, "text": "...of Madam Loretta's\nFortune Telling and Spiritual Parlor."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 246523, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244532, "text": "Got a little bad news, did we, Mr. Gilpin?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 248896, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 246701, "text": "The gypsy robbed me blind."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 251470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249070, "text": "I am not a gypsy."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 255803, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251639, "text": "I am an independent spiritual coordinator."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 258936, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257378, "text": "The woman is a cheat."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 261638, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259113, "text": "She ruined my marriage,\nshe stole my savings..."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 263408, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261816, "text": "...she terrorized my wife."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 265280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 263585, "text": "Don't, Herb. You'll make it worse."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 267421, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 265453, "text": "How can I make it worse, Norma?"}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 271685, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267589, "text": "I'm flat broke\nand you're sleeping with voodoo dolls."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 273884, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 271859, "text": "There are spirits in the house, Herb."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 277225, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 274062, "text": "Well, if they wanna start\nchipping in for the rent, they can stay."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 278558, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277398, "text": "Order, please."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 281099, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278733, "text": "Obviously, there are\nextenuating circumstances here."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 282327, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281269, "text": "Obviously?"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 286303, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282503, "text": "Madam Loretta persuaded my client's wife\nthat there was trouble with their marriage."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 290069, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286474, "text": "I never persuade, I reveal."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 293442, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 290245, "text": "The hanging man\nwas in her fourth house."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 297073, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293615, "text": "And the hanging man is gonna be\nin your house when I get through with you."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 298685, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 297252, "text": "- Mr. Gilpin...\n- And the choking man..."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 301720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298853, "text": "...and the bludgeoning man.\n- All right, that's enough."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 303550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301889, "text": "- I did it for us, Herb.\n- Us?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 304749, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303725, "text": "The more, the merrier."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 307258, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304926, "text": "Our marriage was in the toilet, Herb."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 308622, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307428, "text": "It seemed lost."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 312163, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308796, "text": "I wanted us to be happy again.\nI wanted peace, I wanted love."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 314995, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 312333, "text": "I wanted a Winnebago."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 319564, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316037, "text": "Herb, Norma, it seems the magic you need\nis a little communication."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 321003, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319741, "text": "There was a curse."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 323370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 321175, "text": "- You really believe that, Mrs. Gilpin?\n- Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 327878, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323544, "text": "Eight years ago,\non our 20th anniversary, it happened."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 329874, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328850, "text": "What happened?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 334780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332186, "text": "We stopped having sex."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 338788, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337025, "text": "Let's see, tenth is tin..."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 342589, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 338960, "text": "...twentieth is bunk beds. That's right."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 345289, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343731, "text": "So I was in a little slump."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 348731, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345466, "text": "I don't understand.\nWhat do women want?"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 350632, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348903, "text": "They want magic, Mr. Gilpin."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 353797, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 350805, "text": "Simple spells you can weave\naround your own house."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 357001, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353975, "text": "A whisper, a touch, a kiss for no reason."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 359037, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357445, "text": "Herb."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 360703, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 359213, "text": "Voodoo, Norma."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 365683, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360882, "text": "You squandered our trip\nto Epcot Center on voodoo."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 369617, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 366921, "text": "It's over, Mr. Gilpin. Right, Norma?"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 374327, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370425, "text": "What you're saying\nis that you make your own magic."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 377157, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 374495, "text": "Bingo. Mr. Gilpin?"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 382095, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 377999, "text": "I didn't pay her enough attention.\nIt cost me 13 grand."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 383760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382270, "text": "Fine."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 386805, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383938, "text": "I'll give her attention\ntill it's coming out of her ears."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 392741, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388543, "text": "Mr. Gilpin, the court finds you guilty\nand sentences you to one day in jail."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 394279, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392914, "text": "One day?"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 396542, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394449, "text": "And you are hereby ordered\nto pay for damages."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 401178, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396718, "text": "In light of your financial situation now,\nthat sum shall not exceed $300."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 403153, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401356, "text": "- Bull.\n- Come on."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 405792, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403324, "text": "I'll be there when you get out."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 408962, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406994, "text": "Lucky me."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 411163, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409764, "text": "Call the next case."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 413300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 411332, "text": "Three hundred dollars?"}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 417465, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 414302, "text": "You call that justice? I call it an outrage."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 420766, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417638, "text": "- Look, miss...\n- You have done me great harm."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 424969, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420942, "text": "Do you think I cannot appeal\nto powers greater than your own?"}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 428343, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 425146, "text": "Yeah, that would be the appellate court.\nTwo floors down."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 430916, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428516, "text": "You spit on the great souls?"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 432985, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 431085, "text": "I spit on your justice."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 440186, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 437558, "text": "You probably should've waited\ntill you got to the subway for that."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 442727, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440361, "text": "- That's a $50 fine.\n- Patooie."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 444364, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442897, "text": "Alrighty, make it 100."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 449564, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446868, "text": "- Mac, you keeping a running tab on this?\n- Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 453366, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449737, "text": "If she doesn't run out,\nwe'll be able to afford that new paneling."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 455934, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453875, "text": "Infidel!"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 459637, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456110, "text": "Hey, how about I give you one more chance\nto get a grip on yourself?"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 469820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467955, "text": "- I take it that's a no?\n- Mm."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 473358, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469991, "text": "Enjoy your stay. Contempt of court!"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 476159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473895, "text": "I will not stand for this."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 479561, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476330, "text": "You have incurred\nthe wrath of the pentacles."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 482498, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479734, "text": "I put a curse on this entire courtroom..."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 487039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482670, "text": "...and all who are in it!"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 492378, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487475, "text": "And just when things were starting\nto turn around for me."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 497874, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494882, "text": "- Mac, that bell should've been turned off.\n- I did turn it off, sir."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 506586, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504959, "text": "Hello."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 509125, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507328, "text": "Uh, Dan, it's for you."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 513131, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509297, "text": "Bad news from the IRS."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 516031, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513801, "text": "- Sir, may I?\n- Go ahead, make it quick."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 517296, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516204, "text": "So, what if she's right?"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 521306, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517472, "text": "Not to worry. Sy has phony documents\nto back up everything."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 525037, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 521476, "text": "As for you, Madam Loretta, you've shown\nnothing but contempt for this court."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 527272, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525213, "text": "To stand here and scream about curses."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 529609, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527448, "text": "He's dead?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 530842, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529784, "text": "Who's dead?"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 534117, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531819, "text": "- My accountant.\n- Your accountant died?"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 535346, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534288, "text": "In the middle of the audit."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 537514, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 535523, "text": "They were discussing\nmy Schedule C when:"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 543461, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540094, "text": "I am just warming up."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 545963, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543631, "text": "Bull, get her out of here."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 549763, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548569, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 553031, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549937, "text": "- Your Honor, I can't.\n- Can't what?"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 555437, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553207, "text": "I can't take Madam Loretta\ndown to holding."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 557009, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 555610, "text": "Why?"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 563112, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560848, "text": "That's good enough for me."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 570150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 568523, "text": "Anything else?\n- Not right now, Art."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 572519, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570324, "text": "Thanks for helping us\nmove Bull into the office."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 573717, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572693, "text": "Hey, my pleasure."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 575988, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573895, "text": "I'll let you know if he starts..."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 580195, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 577431, "text": "I'll let you know if he starts\nclamoring for the men's room."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 583394, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580368, "text": "Right. I'll park this baby\nright around the corner."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 584560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583571, "text": "Hey, look at me."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 587465, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585907, "text": "I'm Paul Newman."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 593076, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 591279, "text": "How's he doing, doc?"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 597280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594015, "text": "Well, he can't move,\nbut his vital signs are fine."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 599681, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597451, "text": "His pulse is good,\nthere's no sign of a concussion."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 601583, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599854, "text": "Frankly, it's a little puzzling."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 604418, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 601756, "text": "Anything unusual happen\nbefore he collapsed?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 606059, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604592, "text": "Just the curse."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 610024, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606827, "text": "Of course. The curse."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 612563, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610698, "text": "You made me tell him, didn't you?"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 617303, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 615836, "text": "Doc, what do you make of this?"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 621066, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617471, "text": "Well, I've only read of one case\neven remotely like it."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 623904, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621242, "text": "- Which was?\n- Snow White."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 628208, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625546, "text": "I understand the IRS needs\ndocumented proof, Mr. Birnbaum."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 631215, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628382, "text": "I'm telling you,\nhe had it when he walked in there."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 633751, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631385, "text": "Are you suggesting\nmy accountant's integrity is in question?"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 636981, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633921, "text": "The man was a saint.\nI worshiped the ground he walked on."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 640059, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637158, "text": "Then flop him over.\nMaybe they're underneath him."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 641888, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640227, "text": "Hello? Hello?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 643758, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 642063, "text": "Doctor, is that all you can tell us?"}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 645296, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 643931, "text": "Without tests, yes."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 648492, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645466, "text": "The fainting is explicable\nby any combination of factors."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 650933, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648669, "text": "Hunger, fatigue, excitement."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 653573, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651105, "text": "The paralysis could be\nan allergic reaction."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 655732, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653741, "text": "Or possibly, it's psychosomatic."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 656934, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655910, "text": "What do you suggest?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 659369, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657378, "text": "Lift the curse."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 664409, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660848, "text": "Dr. Fine, if that is your real name..."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 669349, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665720, "text": "...that is advice I would expect\nfrom Madam Loretta, not a physician."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 671514, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 669523, "text": "Look, if he believes\nthat she put a curse on him..."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 674092, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671692, "text": "...maybe he'll believe in her lifting it too."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 675660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674261, "text": "It makes sense."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 678298, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 675830, "text": "Well, if there's no change in his condition\nin an hour or so..."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 682197, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678466, "text": "...you get him over to the hospital\nand I'll run some tests."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 688268, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 686073, "text": "Rise."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 693310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 691479, "text": "No charge."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 697509, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695416, "text": "Mrs. Sanderson? Uh, Dan Fielding."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 700017, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 697685, "text": "Forgive me for calling\nat such an unfortunate hour."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 702655, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700187, "text": "But only we who were closest\nto your husband..."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 705314, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 702823, "text": "...can truly share the grief that..."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 707620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 705993, "text": "Fielding."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 710457, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707795, "text": "I'm sure I'm on his Rolodex."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 712531, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710631, "text": "Yes, I know,\nit is a terrible time for all of us."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 714361, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712700, "text": "That's why I had to know."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 717470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714535, "text": "When Sy left us,\nwith so much ahead of him..."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 719572, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717638, "text": "...so much to live for..."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 722800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719740, "text": "...did they find any papers in his clothes\nwith my name on them?"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 727446, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723544, "text": "I do, and in return you should\nhave a little respect for the living."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 733252, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730818, "text": "Lose weight."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 736618, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733421, "text": "I said that to Sy too."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 748058, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745032, "text": "She's all yours, sir."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 749626, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 748602, "text": "Madam Loretta."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 752904, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750071, "text": "Judge Swine."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 758308, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755976, "text": "You kids have a ball."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 762941, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760347, "text": "- Look...\n- I already know."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 766575, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763117, "text": "The giant one is frozen on your couch."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 771824, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768923, "text": "Sometimes I don't know\nmy own strength."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 774854, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772693, "text": "Lady, you know you're a phony."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 776053, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775029, "text": "I know you're a phony."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 778721, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 776230, "text": "It's just that my bailiff\ndoesn't know you're a phony."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 781800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778899, "text": "So in consideration of, say,\na suspended sentence..."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 783698, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781969, "text": "You want me to lift the curse."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 785634, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 783871, "text": "I want you to pretend to lift the curse."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 788274, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 785806, "text": "If it gets Bull up and around,\nI'm all for it."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 794774, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788676, "text": "Don't be so quick to judge things\nyou know very little about, my young friend."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 797440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 794949, "text": "Lady, now, I try to keep an open mind..."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 800485, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797618, "text": "...but not so open that my brains fall out."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 803316, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800654, "text": "You were born upon a Wednesday."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 805883, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804859, "text": "I don't know."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 808255, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806060, "text": "You do now."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 810188, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 809096, "text": "Look, Madam Loretta..."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 812491, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810364, "text": "You are very concerned\nabout your health."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 817161, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815102, "text": "Oh, come on,\neveryone's concerned about their health."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 819568, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817338, "text": "I mean, that is your scam, right?\nYou take the obvious..."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 822265, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 819740, "text": "...narrow it down a little,\nand feed them what they wanna hear."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 823910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822443, "text": "You doubt my powers?"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 826808, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 824078, "text": "Fix the big oaf yourself."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 828505, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 826981, "text": "This is personal, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 830650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828682, "text": "You just wanna see me cave in."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 834845, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830818, "text": "Oh, the powers that be\nwant to see you cave in."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 838014, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 835022, "text": "You know, you remind me\nof those monte tossers out on the avenue."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 841127, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838192, "text": "You know those kids that will bet you\nmoney that you can't find the queen?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 843889, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 841295, "text": "Have you seen them where they\ntake that game and turn it around..."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 845759, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844064, "text": "...so that you've got the advantage?"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 848197, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845933, "text": "They'll bend the queen\nso that you can't lose her."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 849961, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848369, "text": "There's no way to lose your money."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 853038, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850137, "text": "But what I've learned is\nthat when you've got that advantage..."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 854765, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 853207, "text": "...that's when you've gotta be careful."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 857502, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854942, "text": "Because if you put your money\non the bent card..."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 859873, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857678, "text": "...then the queen's not there."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 862743, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 860047, "text": "Then she's over here."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 866845, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864752, "text": "I mean, she's over here."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 871620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868389, "text": "I believe this belongs to you."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 878354, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873894, "text": "And I believe this belongs to you."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 888002, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886307, "text": "Okay, you guys know what's going on?"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 890735, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888175, "text": "Yeah. I'm paying a drunk\nwho's wearing newspapers for shoes..."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 892879, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890911, "text": "...10 bucks to wait\nby the phone for me..."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 895607, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 893047, "text": "...while forced to watch something\njuvenile and embarrassing..."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 897307, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 895783, "text": "...to cure Bull of his delusions."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 899145, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 897484, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 900947, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899320, "text": "Just checking."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 905286, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903591, "text": "Hey, Bull."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 908326, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905459, "text": "Don't get up. Ha, ha, just kidding."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 910491, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908796, "text": "How's it going, big guy?"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 912256, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910664, "text": "What is this all about?"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 915027, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912433, "text": "I demand an explanation."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 917500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915202, "text": "Don't get your crystal ball in an uproar."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 920469, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917671, "text": "You'll find out soon enough."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 925068, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921041, "text": "Madam Loretta, fellow believers,\nwelcome."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 926570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925512, "text": "What's going on?"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 928806, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926747, "text": "Bull, Harry's found a way\nto get you out of this."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 930507, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928983, "text": "He got her to take the curse off?"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 933482, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930684, "text": "Nope. I am going to take it off myself."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 938524, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 935589, "text": "Oh, this is nonsense.\nYou don't have the power."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 940284, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 938692, "text": "Oh, no?"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 942190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940461, "text": "Ha.\nAh, ha, ha."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 945855, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942363, "text": "Your Honor, I hope this gets better."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 948060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946433, "text": "I hope this gets faster."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 950226, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948235, "text": "Give me a break. I am in mourning."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 953772, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950905, "text": "Mac, bring forth the ceremonial sacrifice."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 955408, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953941, "text": "The Empire State Building."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 958636, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955576, "text": "A symbol of all things really, really big..."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 963306, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958812, "text": "...of all things tall, a symbol of Bull."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 966078, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963484, "text": "You can say that again."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 968187, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966253, "text": "And now the magic book."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 971188, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968355, "text": "The magic book."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 974054, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 971358, "text": "Thank you, Nani Darnell."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 980828, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977665, "text": "\"O spirits of darkness..."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 984732, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981001, "text": "...reveal to us your sacred presence.\""}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 986196, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 985172, "text": "Somebody call me?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 988170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 986373, "text": "Would you hit the street?\nNo."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 992235, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 990210, "text": "Try that again."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 996247, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993380, "text": "\"O spirits of darkness..."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1000786, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 996417, "text": "...present to us your sacred form.\""}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1003184, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001455, "text": "Ooh!"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1010561, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007728, "text": "\"O spirits of the great beyond..."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1014064, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010731, "text": "...I beseech you,\nbestow upon me the power..."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1019433, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014234, "text": "...to rid this poor soul\nof his dreaded curse."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1023074, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021675, "text": "In your name..."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1029580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1023243, "text": "...I banish all evil spirits from this room.\""}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1031012, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029750, "text": "Ooh!"}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1035149, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033454, "text": "That's it. I lifted the curse."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1037017, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1035322, "text": "Bull, stand."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1066151, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1063250, "text": "Hey, a thank-you note\nwould have been plenty."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1068649, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066954, "text": "Don't believe it."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1071086, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068822, "text": "You don't have the power."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1074284, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071258, "text": "Well, for once,\nMadam Loretta, you're right."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1075894, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1074461, "text": "Bull, I hate to tell you this, but..."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1081330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076063, "text": "Let me, Harry.\nI'm better at explaining trickery and deceit."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1084062, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1081502, "text": "Bull, it was fixed."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1085603, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1084238, "text": "- Fixed?\n- It was a hoax."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1087001, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1085773, "text": "- Hoax?\n- Yeah, big guy."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1089506, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087174, "text": "We just wanted to show you\nit was all in your head."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1091644, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1089676, "text": "Art rigged up a flash pot\nand some effects."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1094303, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091812, "text": "He's hiding under the table.\nHe pulled the building down there."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1097939, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094481, "text": "Come on out, Art.\nArt, you can come out."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1099551, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098118, "text": "- Art?\n- Sorry I'm late, sir."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1102120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099720, "text": "I got stuck in the elevator\nwhen the power went out."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1104416, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102289, "text": "I think I got everything\nyou asked for, though."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1108584, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104591, "text": "Here's your magic flash powder,\nyour comedy tubing..."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1110525, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108762, "text": "...your novelty burning book."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1117700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113934, "text": "Oh, I thought you could use a little help."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1122266, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1119706, "text": "Excuse me, do you mean that you?"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1127838, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124311, "text": "- Exxon's earnings, where will they level at?\n- Oh."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1133646, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128982, "text": "May I be of any further assistance,\nJudge Stone?"}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1135719, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134354, "text": "No, you're free to go."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1138416, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136323, "text": "I knew you'd say that."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1143052, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141528, "text": "Here."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1145960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143230, "text": "- What's this?\n- A phone number."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1150433, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146133, "text": "It will soothe your troubled spirits."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1155974, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152573, "text": "- Madam Loretta.\n- You're welcome."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1161474, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1159813, "text": "- Booga, booga!\n- Aah!"}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1166011, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164885, "text": "Just kidding."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1195304, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193313, "text": "Dan, you okay?"}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1198618, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197151, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1203622, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200721, "text": "Dan, I can't talk to hair."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1209218, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206727, "text": "A receipt from the IRS?"}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1215901, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1210531, "text": "\"Seventy-four thousand, 861 dollars."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1218162, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216069, "text": "Paid in full."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1221307, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218338, "text": "Thanks for stopping by.\""}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1225310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1222910, "text": "They took it all?"}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1227741, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226046, "text": "Well, what did they disallow?"}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1232444, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230817, "text": "Everything?"}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1235144, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1232619, "text": "Even contributions to charities?"}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1240192, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1237724, "text": "Yeah, right. What was I thinking?"}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1245154, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242629, "text": "You mean to tell me you're broke?"}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1248324, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245332, "text": "Wiped out? Flat busted?"}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1250970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248502, "text": "Bereft of funds?"}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1256201, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251138, "text": "Oh, Dan, I am so sorry."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1260403, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258378, "text": "If there is anything I can do..."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1267518, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262683, "text": "Oh, no, Dan, I make it a policy\nnever to loan money to a friend."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1273219, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271058, "text": "I hate you!"}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1275287, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273660, "text": "You're scum!"}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1278124, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275462, "text": "We were never friends!"}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1283599, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281335, "text": "Nice try, amigo."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1295048, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292079, "text": "I got it. I got it."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1297911, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295215, "text": "The air was particularly dry."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1301179, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298085, "text": "A wire from the ceiling lamp\nbrushed up against a metal pipe..."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1303016, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1301355, "text": "...causing the explosion and flash."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1306887, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303190, "text": "An unsuspecting janitor passing by,\nheard the noise, rushed in, saw the smoke..."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1309460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307060, "text": "...came into the room\nwithout our even seeing him..."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1312565, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309630, "text": "...grabbed the model\nof the Empire State Building and left."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1316902, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1314968, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1319462, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1317437, "text": "Aliens took it."}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1323499, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320507, "text": "Billie, let's face it, I don't know how,\nI don't when, I don't know where..."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1326145, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1323677, "text": "...but somehow,\nMadam Loretta outfoxed me."}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1328974, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326847, "text": "- You still think that was a trick?\n- Had to be."}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1330480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1329149, "text": "If I can do something like that..."}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1333484, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1330651, "text": "...she's certainly capable\nof performing the same illusion."}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1334712, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333654, "text": "Maybe, but..."}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1338187, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334888, "text": "Oh, come on, you don't still think\nshe has real magical powers, do you?"}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1339791, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1338358, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1342695, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1341228, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 383, "end_ms": 1344194, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1342863, "text": "Billie, I'm surprised at you."}
{"cue": 384, "end_ms": 1347060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344364, "text": "Harry, what about that phone number\nshe gave you to call?"}
{"cue": 385, "end_ms": 1349225, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1347234, "text": "What, this?\nThat's probably some recorded message."}
{"cue": 386, "end_ms": 1352338, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1349403, "text": "You know, dial-a-curse,\nsomething like that."}
{"cue": 387, "end_ms": 1357440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1353106, "text": "She said that it would\nease your troubled spirit."}
{"cue": 388, "end_ms": 1360674, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1357978, "text": "Okay, I'm up for a good laugh."}
{"cue": 389, "end_ms": 1366449, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1362683, "text": "O ancient specter from beyond..."}
{"cue": 390, "end_ms": 1372581, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1366620, "text": "...reveal to me the voice\nthat will soothe my troubled spirit."}
{"cue": 391, "end_ms": 1378328, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1376997, "text": "<i>Hi, this is Mel Tormé.</i>"}
{"cue": 392, "end_ms": 1381194, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1378498, "text": "<i>I can't come to the phone right now,\nbut I'd like to know you called.</i>"}
{"cue": 393, "end_ms": 1384166, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1381368, "text": "<i>So, uh, please leave a message\nat the sound of the, uh...</i>"}
{"cue": 394, "end_ms": 1390532, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1389543, "text": "<i>The beep.</i>"}
